  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile setups (e.g., config_018) outperform singleprofile ones, but the impact of image encoder choice (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) remains untested. This experiment tests the same aggregation (avgpool) and fusion (concat) as config_018 but with a different image encoder (imagenet_vit_l), isolating its effect on performance. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether the image encoder choice is critical, leveraging the strong prior evidence for multiprofile setups to focus on a key design decision."
}

